message: If you use Vision Tower Bench or its results, please cite it.
title: "Vision Tower Bench"
abstract: >-
  Vision Tower Bench probes frozen open vision towers across recognition,
  geometry, correspondence and robustness. It isolates the tower, layer, and
  projector that full-model VLM benchmarks mix together.
